  "Scenes.Lumberjack.End.SalvageTheRemains": "[pg]With all things said and done, you have free reign to salvage anything you can here. You take the time to sort and organize all the tools you could practically need, assuring that you can carry whatever you're able in a single trip. As you assess the pile of cut lumber, ready for use, it occurs to you that multiple trips will be unavoidable to get everything worth taking. Over the next few hours, you collect all the easily gathered supplies...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Lumberjack.End.Text": "[b:(Gained Key Item: Carpenter's Toolbox)][pg-]"
  "Scenes.Lumberjack.EndReturnCamp": "[pg]With your supplies gathered, you head back to camp."
